{"id":"5925","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5925_main_invading-altocumulus-floccus-duplicatus-radiatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这是侵入的高积云双层云带前缘，该云快速增厚及云量增加。</p>\n<p>下层的高积云呈深灰色（树的上方），它由积状云簇构成，且大部分<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云底边界清晰</span>。在这些云的左侧，云底正在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">消散并破碎</span>。</p>\n<p>上层的云层呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中灰色</span>，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">最薄的部分发白</span>。这个云层中的云素正合并为长线，似乎正向地平线附近的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一个点上汇集</span>。这是辐辏状云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"英国，伯克郡RG7，雷丁附近的斯特拉特菲尔德莫蒂默","latitude":"纬度: 51° 22' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 2' 24'' W","date":"10 July 2010 2040 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 8, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.12","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.12"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5925_syn_invading-altocumulus-floccus-duplicatus-radiatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在拍摄这张照片时，浅的开放波低气压在不列颠群岛西部上空发展，极为接近在法国东部上空发展的另一个波。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5925_sat_invading-altocumulus-floccus-duplicatus-radiatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在英国英格兰斯特拉特菲尔德莫蒂默以东地区可看到在高积云之前的卷云。侵入的高积云前在西边约50公里。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2010","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4534_main_altocumulus-lenticularis-radiatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>图片下部显示许多雪茄状高积云块，末端整体呈纤维状但非丝状。波状云带（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>）被侧面光照亮，显示出叠加的云层，其中四层在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3处</span>清晰可辨，底部平坦、水平呈灰白色。当时在距观测点200和300公里的图尔与雷恩也观测到相似云层。一个弱大西洋低压系统从菲尼斯特雷角延伸至康沃尔，一股强劲的西南向高空气流正穿越比利牛斯山脉。大气极不稳定，法国南部及西部地区有雷暴活动。</p></div>","copyright":"© L. Buffault","location":"Saint-Brice-sous-Forêt, Seine-et-Oise, France","latitude":"纬度: 48° 59' 58'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 21' 22'' E","date":"25 August 1950 1758 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 4, CH= 0","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4392_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-translucidus-perlucidus-radiatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这一层高积云明显是半透明的（透光变种）。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处的云体之间存在许多间隙，也使得天空得以显露（漏光变种）。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处出现的近乎相互平行的拉长云体，表明了波状变种（undulatus）；此外，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">7</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">8</span>处，画面中还存在横贯的带状结构（辐辏变种，radiatus）。这层云正快速侵入天空；在拍摄方向上，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">9</span>处仍留有空隙。观测站位于海洋极地暖气团中，距离一个自西向东移动的冷锋前方约100公里，该冷锋在上午晚些时候及之后引发了分散的雷暴。6公里以下为西南至西南西风。</p></div>","copyright":"© L. Buffault","location":"Carnac, France","latitude":"纬度: 47° 35' 5'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 4' 40'' W","date":"30 July 1950 0631 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 5, CH= 0","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}